WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.920
Most after-school club owners I know started because they

00:00:02.920 --> 00:00:04.020
love working with kids.

00:00:04.680 --> 00:00:07.320
Then the admin ate their evenings, registration forms,

00:00:07.320 --> 00:00:09.960
chasing payments, contracts, endless

00:00:09.960 --> 00:00:12.780
messages from parents. We know it firsthand. At Robotics

00:00:12.780 --> 00:00:15.260
Academy, we teach more than 10,000

00:00:15.260 --> 00:00:18.600
kids a year, and the paperwork almost ran us. So we built

00:00:18.600 --> 00:00:21.240
ExoClass. Parents register and

00:00:21.240 --> 00:00:24.470
pay online. Invoices and reminders go out on their own.

00:00:24.470 --> 00:00:26.560
Contracts are signed digitally.

00:00:26.920 --> 00:00:30.200
Coaches mark attendance on their phone. Today, more than 60

00:00:30.200 --> 00:00:32.500
providers use it, across 11 kinds

00:00:32.500 --> 00:00:36.280
of activities. Dance, football, martial arts, music,

00:00:36.280 --> 00:00:39.700
robotics, and more. Over 20,000 children.

00:00:40.220 --> 00:00:42.430
One modelling school owner told us they used to spend

00:00:42.430 --> 00:00:45.540
several extra hours on admin. Now, that

00:00:45.540 --> 00:00:48.480
time goes back to the kids. I'm Kris. Linas built the

00:00:48.480 --> 00:00:51.480
product, Lukas runs operations. We're

00:00:51.480 --> 00:00:54.250
operators first, and we're in Singapore looking for our

00:00:54.250 --> 00:00:55.620
first partner centres.

00:00:55.840 --> 00:00:59.620
So book 15 minutes with us. If it fits, we'll help you move

00:00:59.620 --> 00:01:00.560
your data over.

